## 6. Walk-forward 驗證

```python
# vbt_analytics.py
def walk_forward(factor, stock, params, split=0.7):
    """
    70% in-sample (訓練期), 30% out-of-sample (驗證期)
    按時間順序切, 唔 shuffle (避免前視偏差)
    """
    close = load_stock_close(stock)
    factor = load_factor_close(factor)
    common = factor.index.intersection(close.index)
    cut = int(len(common) * split)
    is_idx, oos_idx = common[:cut], common[cut:]
    # 分別起 IS/OOS Portfolio
    is_pf = build_portfolio(is_idx, ...)
    oos_pf = build_portfolio(oos_idx, ...)
    return {
        "is_sharpe": is_pf.sharpe_ratio(),
        "oos_sharpe": oos_pf.sharpe_ratio(),
        "is_return": is_pf.total_return() * 100,
        "oos_return": oos_pf.total_return() * 100,
        "figure": combined_plot,  # IS vs OOS 淨值對比 subplot
    }
```
**驗證**: OOS Sharpe 同 CSV `oos_sharpe` 欄位對照 (DXY→00016 應 ≈ 2.37)。

